#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color=""></font>
I press the button to close the doors again, and we go towards the observatory together. [l]
[playse storage=BGS/elevator_up.ogg loop=true clear=false layer=3]
[fadeoutbgm time=3000]
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking.png" time=200 cross=false]
As usual, Alexeï says nothing. [l]But I could feel his frustration and unease at this whole situation just from his expression. [l]
[playse storage=SoundEffects_Action/door1_soft.ogg loop=false clear=false layer=1]
I take the music box Joshua gave me back yesterday in my hand.
[playbgm storage="/music/musicbox.ogg"]
Without thinking, I turn the key, and let the gentle melody fill the air. [l]
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex.png" time=200 cross=false]
Alexeï noticed, and stood up straight. [l]Looks like the music woke him up from his silent thoughts.[p]
I hope she'll be happy I found a way to repair it. [l]It's only been around twelve hours since I've last seen her, but it feels like days. [l]I couldn't have imagined growing so attached to the people here in such a short time span. [p]

[fadeoutbgm time=3000]
[chara_hide_all time="888" wait="false"]
[bg storage=black.png method=crossfade time=1000 wait=true]
The elevator gates open. [l]Alex and I turn around the elevator, as we expect Nicola to still be in front of her computer. [p]
[wait time=2000]
And... [l]Somehow, I was expecting something like this. [l]I was lying to myself, hoping to myself that everything was going to be fine. [p]
I thought I would be able to see Nicola again, about to hear her tell me some silly jokes. [l][r]
I thought I could hear more from her, hear her theories about our work, witness her professionalism she hid so well behind a faithful and hopeful smile. [l][r]
I thought I would be ready. [l][r]
I thought I could fight those feelings. [l][r]
I thought I could face my worst fear. [p]
[wait time=2000]
But no. [p]
[wait time=2000]
[playbgm storage="/music/11_-_Clinical_Tension_-_postblankvoid"]
In front of my eyes, lying on the ground... [l]Was Nicola, face down in a puddle of a crimson liquid. [p]
It was like the entire picture unfolded in front of my eyes. [l]The first thing I noticed was her arm exposed with her palm wide open, as if she was trying to reach out for something. [l]Paper and writing tools were scattered all over the place. [l]What was left of my humanity was convincing myself that no, she's probably just asleep. [p]
Maybe I'm dreaming. [l][r]Maybe I'm imagining it. [l][r]Maybe it's a doll. [l][r]Maybe this was all an elaborate and tasteless ruse. [l]
[wait time=1000]
No. [l]I shouldn't lie to myself. [l]My eyes and heart burn, but Nicola was, and could only be dead. [l]Her face, her stiff body, her cold skin...[l][r]
But her expression. [l]No kind of acting could ever mimic this kind of expression. [l]This could only be her, and she's gone. [p]
You would expect a dead body to look in pain, but Nicola almost looked at peace. [l]Her eyes were closed, and her mouth showed what was close to an empathic smile. [l]This is so unfair. [l]How can she look like this? [l]Did she not realize what was going on? [l]Or had she realized what was coming, and yet she smiled despite the circumstances? [p]
Was she smiling at the stars? [l]Was she smiling at someone? [l]You might think she was having a pleasant dream. [l]The possibility was there, but I couldn't imagine her taking away her own life. [l]Nicola was too optimistic of a person, and had way too many plans for her to even dare think about that. [l]I only knew her for a few days, but I'm sure of it. [l]Someone did this to her. [p]
Blood seemed to seep from her throat. [l]It was a clean, yet gruesome wound. [l]From such a wide cut, it looked like a blade did it. [l]Her torso was stained with blood as well, just as much as her back and arms. [l]But the blood was already dry. [l]This incident wasn't done too recently. [l]It was probably at night. [p]
[wait time=2000]
This is too cruel. [l][r]This is too fucking cruel. [l][r]Who would do that. [l][r]Why would anyone do that. [l][r]Who could even do something like this? [l]How much of a bloodthirsty monster must you be to kill someone, and in such a way? [l]It looks like someone was trying to hurt her, more than trying to kill her. [p]
I wanted to throw up. [l]But my entire body was shaken up like I’d been turned upside down, with all of my organs failing to function properly. [p]
...[l]Clearly, there weren’t many signs to give me hope that she could be still alive. [l]As I analyzed this whole picture, I thought I could save her in some way. [l]Like in movies, you think they're dead, but there's still hope. [l]All it takes is for the hero to miraculously save them from certain death, no matter what happens. [p]
But this is not a movie. [l]There is no hero. [l]Nicola is there. [l]She's already dead. [l]I will never see her full of life ever again, and yet the last memory I have of her is still so fresh. [l]It feels awful, disgusting, painful. [p]
Guilt, remorse, anger and disgust were fueling my brain and entire body, and it hurt so bad I wanted to rip out my heart with my own hands. [l]I wanted to scream from my lungs, but my throat felt so dry and tight I could not even breathe. [l]I started hating the others, for being unable to protect her. [l]Then I started to hate myself, for  being unable to anticipate this, and help her myself. [p]

[bg storage=Backgrounds/bg09_observatory.png method=crossfade time=1000 wait=true]
[chara_show  name="Alexei"  time="1000"  wait="true"  storage="chara/4/alex.png"  width="495"  height="720"  left="410"  top="0"  reflect="false"]
It took me seconds to realize my knees were on the ground, and my entire body was frozen and shaking. [l]For a moment there, I forgot Alexeï was here. [l]I did not look at him, but he seemed dumbfounded as well. [l]However, he was the first to act. [l]I could see him, frenetically tapping on his watch, before screaming in anger. [p]
[chara_hide_all time="888" wait="false"]
[bg storage=black.ong method=crossfade time=1000 wait=true]
But I was completely deaf. [l]I could not hear a single thing, despite a buzzing that passed through my brain, as if it was in sleep mode after witnessing so much. [l]
[chara_show  name="Alexei"  time="1000"  wait="true"  storage="chara/4/alex.png"  width="495"  height="720"  left="410"  top="0"  reflect="false"]
[bg storage=Backgrounds/bg09_observatory.png method=crossfade time=1000 wait=true]
Slowly, my consciousness came back to me. [l]
[playse storage=SoundEffects_Action/door1_soft.ogg loop=false clear=false layer=1]
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_lookout.png" time=200 cross=false]
Alexeï came to me, took my arm, and made me stand up. [p]
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_stare.png" time=200 cross=false]

